{"unit_id":"Shtukbase__elephant-memory#card-zh","repo":"Shtukbase/elephant-memory","commit":"520352a5196f700fe484c17b0a708dd5d343e863","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Elephant Memory 是面向 DSH web 客户端的跨会话记忆插件。它以独立 Endless preset 替换普通压缩流程，在每轮开始时用有界摘要视图承载项目中的历史，并可自动补入相关原文片段。主要功能包括后台生成和合并摘要、按问题排序检索历史、逐层展开摘要查看原始消息、按短语或正则搜索记录，以及整理带日期的决定和规则。它还提供浏览器记忆查看界面和 recall、zoom、date 等 agent 工具，适合需要在多个聊天间延续上下文并追溯原话的 DSH 用户。摘要使用当前聊天的模型与提供方；默认记忆目录位于 DSH home 下的 endless。","source":"generated","evidence":["presets/endless.patch.yml:1","lib/engine.js:35","lib/step-one.js:4","lib/tools.js:25","lib/browser-routes.js:85"]}
{"unit_id":"Shtukbase__elephant-memory#card-en","repo":"Shtukbase/elephant-memory","commit":"520352a5196f700fe484c17b0a708dd5d343e863","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Elephant Memory carries project history across DSH chats. Its Endless preset starts each turn with a bounded summary and retrieves relevant original passages. Features include ranked recall, phrase search, summary expansion, a dated decision journal, and a browser view of stored memories.","source":"generated","evidence":["presets/endless.patch.yml:1","lib/engine.js:35","lib/step-one.js:4","lib/tools.js:25","lib/browser-routes.js:85"]}
